"sourcePersonId":"vndb:s2789","canonicalEntityId":"vndb:s2789","name":"高島 洋祐","roleCode":"staff","roleLabel":"制作人员","identityStatus":"source-native","relationId":"vndb:vn-staff:179495","source":"vndb"},{"creditedName":"八日 なのか","creatorId":"vndb:s4808","sourcePersonId":"vndb:s4808","canonicalEntityId":"vndb:s4808","name":"八日なのか","roleCode":"staff","roleLabel":"制作人员","identityStatus":"source-native","relationId":"vndb:vn-staff:179497","source":"vndb"},{"creditedName":"なつき ゆう","creatorId":"vndb:s4885","sourcePersonId":"vndb:s4885","canonicalEntityId":"vndb:s4885","name":"なつき ゆう","roleCode":"staff","roleLabel":"制作人员","identityStatus":"source-native","relationId":"vndb:vn-staff:179500","source":"vndb"},{"creditedName":"Rin'ca","creatorId":"vndb:s8804","sourcePersonId":"vndb:s8804","canonicalEntityId":"vndb:s8804","name":"Rin'ca","roleCode":"songs","roleLabel":"歌曲","identityStatus":"source-native","relationId":"vndb:vn-staff:179501","source":"vndb"},{"creditedName":"朝霧 はやと","creatorId":"vndb:s8821","sourcePersonId":"vndb:s8821","canonicalEntityId":"vndb:s8821","name":"朝霧 隼翔","roleCode":"staff","roleLabel":"制作人员","identityStatus":"source-native","relationId":"vndb:vn-staff:179503","source":"vndb"},{"creditedName":"ユウキ ナオヒロ","creatorId":"vndb:s19921","sourcePersonId":"vndb:s19921","canonicalEntityId":"vndb:s19921","name":"ユウキナオヒロ","roleCode":"staff","roleLabel":"制作人员","identityStatus":"source-native","relationId":"vndb:vn-staff:179505","source":"vndb"},{"creditedName":"rian","creatorId":"vndb:s42806","sourcePersonId":"vndb:s42806","canonicalEntityId":"vndb:s42806","name":"rian","roleCode":"staff","roleLabel":"制作人员","identityStatus":"source-native","relationId":"vndb:vn-staff:179507","source":"vndb"}]},"cast":[{"characterId":"char_c101092","characterName":"ブタちゃん","sourceIds":{"bangumi":[{"characterId":"102684","match":"exact-normalized-name-in-linked-work","subjectId":"356907"}],"egsCharacterIds":["23894"],"vndbCharacterId":"c101092"},"originalCharacterName":"ブタちゃん","characterNameSource":null,"role":"primary","status":"source-only-candidate","identityStatus":"confirmed-redirect","metadata":{"age":{"reviewState":"no-conflict","source":"vndb","value":"20"},"sex":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"f"}},"descriptions":[{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"Yua is the total package – brains, beauty, and a dazzling personality that makes everyone green with envy. She's the ultimate high-maintenance queen, the kind of girl who's always just out of reach."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"She never lets her guard down easily, and her confident, all-knowing gaze can make you feel like she's got you all figured out."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"At this point, Yua feels less like a heroine and more like the final boss in a video game."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"Still – she's got a mischievous streak and loves to mess with people. Every now and then, she'll let her playful side show... if you're lucky enough to catch it."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"Translated from the official website"}],"source":"vndb","sourceCharacterId":"c101092"},{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"才色兼備で振る舞いも明るく、誰もが羨む人気者。そして難攻不落の高嶺の花。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"簡単に素顔や弱みを見せてはくれない上に、自信たっぷりになにもかも見透かしたような視線を向けてくる。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"もはやヒロインというよりは、ラスボスに近しい存在感を放っている。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"だけどイタズラや人をからかうことが大好きなので、たまにお茶目な一面も見せてくれることも……あったりなかったりする。"}],"source":"egs","sourceCharacterId":"23894","sourceWorkId":"31900","spoiler":false},{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"才色兼備で振る舞いも明るく、誰もが羨む人気者。そして難攻不落の高嶺の花。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"簡単に素顔や弱みを見せてはくれない上に、自信たっぷりになにもかも見透かしたような視線を向けてくる。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"もはやヒロインというよりは、ラスボスに近しい存在感を放っている。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"だけどイタズラや人をからかうことが大好きなので、"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"たまにお茶目な一面も見せてくれることも……あったりなかったりする。"}],"source":"bangumi","sourceCharacterId":"102684"}],"profileFacts":[],"metadataCandidateConflicts":{},"image":{"url":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/53/53f2c8e46941c0554026c9a3eb9780fe8777be924b56e9419c0bad9b69e6ad0b.webp","fallbackUrl":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/76/76ed221ad53646de59745cf4e602ba80b3b877784d7be04b797b32e726fb4238.webp","width":81,"height":256,"source":"static-detail"},"actors":[{"creditedName":"三宅麻理恵","creatorId":"vndb:s2258","sourcePersonId":"vndb:s2258","canonicalEntityId":"vndb:s2258","name":"三宅 麻理恵","roleCode":"voice-actor","roleLabel":"声优","identityStatus":"auto-confirmed","relationId":"bangumi:character-voice:356907:102684:6846:1","source":"bangumi"}]},{"characterId":"char_c101093","characterName":"タコ焼き娘","sourceIds":{"bangumi":[{"characterId":"102685","match":"exact-normalized-name-in-linked-work","subjectId":"356907"}],"egsCharacterIds":["23895"],"vndbCharacterId":"c101093"},"originalCharacterName":"タコ焼き娘","characterNameSource":null,"role":"primary","status":"source-only-candidate","identityStatus":"confirmed-redirect","metadata":{"sex":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"f"}},"descriptions":[{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"Raised abroad for most of her life, Kirame is a half-Japanese girl who landed in Japan for her studies. Her favorite food? Takoyaki, hands down."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"Kirame usually plays the part of the demure damsel, but she's a bundle of sensitivity and expressiveness – often blurting out \"Hwa!?\" in surprise or bawling \"Bueee~\" when she's upset. It's such an emotional rollercoaster."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"After a tipsy night, she mistakenly believes she had a one-night stand with Nao, who was just trying to be a good Samaritan. Now, she's decided the protagonist needs to step up and take responsibility."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"Kirame is pretty shy and struggles to make friends, even though she craves them. Her roommate, Layla, is her only close friend."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"Despite her shyness, Kirame has a heart of gold and a knack for understanding others' feelings. But her Achilles' heel? She's a pushover and easily swayed by others."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"Translated from the official website"}],"source":"vndb","sourceCharacterId":"c101093"},{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"長らく海外育ちで留学にやってきたハーフ娘。タコ焼きが大好物。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"普段はお淑やかぶっているが、感受性豊かで、ホワッ！？と驚いたり、ぶえぇえ～と泣いたりして忙しい。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"酔った勢いで介抱してくれた主人公とワンナイトな関係を持ってしまったと勘違いし、その責任をとってもらうことにする。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"人見知りしがちなので、友達を作るのが苦手。とっても友達を欲しがっている。ルームメイトのレイラは唯一の親友。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"人の気持ちをしっかりと考えられる優しさを持っている。一方で、押しに弱く、流されやすいのが玉に瑕。"}],"source":"egs","sourceCharacterId":"23895","sourceWorkId":"31900","spoiler":false},{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"長らく海外育ちで留学にやってきたハーフ娘。タコ焼きが大好物。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"普段はお淑やかぶっているが、感受性豊かで、ホワッ！？と驚いたり、ぶえぇえ～と泣いたりして忙しい。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"酔った勢いで介抱してくれた主人公とワンナイトな関係を持ってしまったと勘違いし、その責任をとってもらうことにする。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"人見知りしがちなので、友達を作るのが苦手。とっても友達を欲しがっている。ルームメイトのレイラは唯一の親友。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"人の気持ちをしっかりと考えられる優しさを持っている。一方で、押しに弱く、流されやすいのが玉に瑕。"}],"source":"bangumi","sourceCharacterId":"102685"}],"profileFacts":[],"metadataCandidateConflicts":{},"image":{"url":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/a7/a784f788c0838a2904a58b1709dbd5553bf08f1aa6bf687f081a38b52da73221.webp","fallbackUrl":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/a5/a574d3eb689c4ae50e4ad5d15a5eb07ebb4de6b69fecf2918f926c7ec4097851.webp","width":82,"height":256,"source":"static-detail"},"actors":[{"creditedName":"谷口夢奈","creatorId":"vndb:s14335","sourcePersonId":"vndb:s14335","canonicalEntityId":"vndb:s14335","name":"谷口 夢奈","roleCode":"voice-actor","roleLabel":"声优","identityStatus":"auto-confirmed","relationId":"bangumi:character-voice:356907:102685:29570:1","source":"bangumi"}]},{"characterId":"char_c101094","characterName":"ルイルイ","sourceIds":{"bangumi":[{"characterId":"102686","match":"exact-normalized-name-in-linked-work","subjectId":"356907"}],"egsCharacterIds":["23896"],"vndbCharacterId":"c101094"},"originalCharacterName":"ルイルイ","characterNameSource":null,"role":"primary","status":"source-only-candidate","identityStatus":"confirmed-redirect","metadata":{"age":{"reviewState":"no-conflict","source":"vndb","value":"20"},"sex":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"f"}},"descriptions":[{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"Rui's a secret geek who keeps her otaku side under wraps. Online though? She's killing it as a cosplayer with quite the following. She's so deep in the otaku rabbit hole that she plays it cool at university to blend in."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"These days she's itching for some fellow geek friends. For whatever reason, Rui's got this thing about Yua and happens to be the only one in on the protagonist's dirty little secret - that he's playing both Yua and Kirame."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"She comes off as bossy and tough as nails, which makes people think twice before approaching her, but beneath all that attitude, Rui's got a heart of gold. Sure, she'll grumble and roll her eyes, but she'll always have your back when it counts."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"Translated from the official website"}],"source":"vndb","sourceCharacterId":"c101094"},{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"隠れオタ女子。ＳＮＳ上では結構有名なコスプレイヤー。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"かなりディープな厄介オタクなので、大学では猫被っている。オタ友が欲しい今日この頃。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"理由は定かではないが結愛に執着し続けていて、唯一主人公が結愛と煌に二股をかけていることを知っている。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"高圧的な物言いと、気の強さからお近づきになるのに勇気が要るが、なんだかんだ面倒見がよく、ため息や悪態つきながらも助けてくれるめっちゃいい人。"}],"source":"egs","sourceCharacterId":"23896","sourceWorkId":"31900","spoiler":false},{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"隠れオタ女子。ＳＮＳ上では結構有名なコスプレイヤー。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"かなりディープな厄介オタクなので、大学では猫被っている。オタ友が欲しい今日この頃。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"理由は定かではないが結愛に執着し続けていて、唯一主人公が結愛と煌に二股をかけていることを知っている。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"高圧的な物言いと、気の強さからお近づきになるのに勇気が要るが、 なんだかんだ面倒見がよく、ため息や悪態つきながらも助けてくれるめっちゃいい人。"}],"source":"bangumi","sourceCharacterId":"102686"}],"profileFacts":[],"metadataCandidateConflicts":{},"image":{"url":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/08/08b73688aa8ab0a17ab9c52ba8878f2b7b8ec8a61d86890f1374311125911248.webp","fallbackUrl":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/57/575b1d61c8305cd7be05224ba25f2fc0c60d609694136f75c2c24a9d4932a324.webp","width":104,"height":256,"source":"static-detail"},"actors":[{"creditedName":"井ノ上奈々","creatorId":"vndb:s1808","sourcePersonId":"vndb:s1808","canonicalEntityId":"vndb:s1808","name":"井ノ上奈々","roleCode":"voice-actor","roleLabel":"声优","identityStatus":"auto-confirmed","relationId":"bangumi:character-voice:356907:102686:4745:1","source":"bangumi"}]},{"characterId":"char_c101095","characterName":"みゃーこ","sourceIds":{"bangumi":[{"characterId":"102688","match":"exact-normalized-name-in-linked-work","subjectId":"356907"}],"egsCharacterIds":["23897"],"vndbCharacterId":"c101095"},"originalCharacterName":"みゃーこ","characterNameSource":null,"role":"primary","status":"source-only-candidate","identityStatus":"confirmed-redirect","metadata":{"sex":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"f"}},"descriptions":[{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"Umino Miyako has a personality like a street-smart alley cat. Usually, she's as aloof as they come, both in words and deeds. But just when you least expect it, she's cozying up to you—talk about a fickle feline!"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"Don't let Miyako's cool cucumber act fool you. Behind that calm facade, she's quite the social butterfly, juggling a surprisingly packed calendar and a friend circle that's way more extensive than you'd expect. Talk about still waters running deep!"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"Miyako is head over heels for the ocean. She's always itching to swing by the beach after class or spend her days off just staring at the waves, lost in thought."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"Miyako and our protagonist go way back, and they're thick as thieves. Their closeness often leads people to jump to conclusions, thinking they're an item. But for these two? They don't see each other that way."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"Translated from the official website"}],"source":"vndb","sourceCharacterId":"c101095"},{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"人慣れした野良猫みたいな性格で、普段は言動も行動も素っ気ないが、ふと気づけばすり寄ってきたりと非常に気まぐれ。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"落ち着いている印象を持たれがちだが、友達も意外とたくさんいてそこそこアクティブ。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"海がとても好きで、よく大学帰りに寄りたがったり、休みの日にぼんやり眺めてたりする。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"主人公とはそれなりに付き合いが長く、距離感も近いので、周りからは付き合っているように見えがちだが、本人たちにその気はない。"}],"source":"egs","sourceCharacterId":"23897","sourceWorkId":"31900","spoiler":false},{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"人慣れした野良猫みたいな性格で、普段は言動も行動も素っ気ないが、ふと気づけばすり寄ってきたりと非常に気まぐれ。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"落ち着いている印象を持たれがちだが、友達も意外とたくさんいてそこそこアクティブ。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"海がとても好きで、よく大学帰りに寄りたがったり、休みの日にぼんやり眺めてたりする。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"主人公とはそれなりに付き合いが長く、距離感も近いので、周りからは付き合っているように見えがちだが、本人たちにその気はない。"}],"source":"bangumi","sourceCharacterId":"102688"}],"profileFacts":[],"metadataCandidateConflicts":{},"image":{"url":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/92/92f6d2d99ebe86dd8c8889acedc6d7f79cf4b4291e8c14401f170cf31e10712d.webp","fallbackUrl":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/9c/9ccb75ce035f1cc989919d36dbf1ffd367b2cefa4de114951579c365b3c9023d.webp","width":158,"height":256,"source":"static-detail"},"actors":[{"creditedName":"佐々木未来","creatorId":"vndb:s3660","sourcePersonId":"vndb:s3660","canonicalEntityId":"vndb:s3660","name":"佐々木 未来","roleCode":"voice-actor","roleLabel":"声优","identityStatus":"auto-confirmed","relationId":"bangumi:character-voice:356907:102688:7277:1","source":"bangumi"}]},{"characterId":"char_c101227","characterName":"古賀 凪青","sourceIds":{"bangumi":[{"characterId":"103005","match":"exact-normalized-name-in-linked-work","subjectId":"356907"}],"egsCharacterIds":["23898"],"vndbCharacterId":"c101227"},"originalCharacterName":"古賀 凪青","characterNameSource":null,"role":"main","status":"source-only-candidate","identityStatus":"confirmed-redirect","metadata":{"age":{"reviewState":"no-conflict","source":"vndb","value":"20"},"sex":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"m"}},"descriptions":[{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"Nao's got a quirky personality and marches to the beat of his own drum. Chronic insomnia often leaves him with dark circles under his eyes and a perpetually sleepy look."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"Thanks to a misunderstanding with Kirame, he ends up in a situation that looks suspiciously like a one-night stand. To make matters worse, his long-time crush, Yua, suddenly decides to respond to his confession, which he had left hanging for ages. Just like that, he's slapped with the title of a two-timing scoundrel."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"Nao tries to roll with the punches, figuring what's done is done, but he has absolutely no idea what to do next."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"Translated from the official website"}],"source":"vndb","sourceCharacterId":"c101227"},{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"本作主人公。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"ひょうきんな性格で、マイペース。慢性的な不眠症でよく目の下にクマを作っていたり、糸目になってたりする。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"煌と誤解ではあるものの、ワンナイト紛いなことをしてしまい、さらにはずっと保留にしていた告白の返事を結愛が急に返してきたせいで、いきなり二股クズ野郎の称号を押しつけられることに。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"二股しちゃったものはしょうがないと開き直るが、今後のビジョンはまったく持ち合わせていない。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"ちなみに『女の子の泣く顔が好き』という、どうしようもなくクズ感の出る特殊性癖の持ち主。"}],"source":"egs","sourceCharacterId":"23898","sourceWorkId":"31900","spoiler":false},{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"本作主人公。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"ひょうきんな性格で、マイペース。慢性的な不眠症でよく目の下にクマを作っていたり、糸目になってたりする。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"煌と誤解ではあるものの、ワンナイト紛いなことをしてしまい、さらにはずっと保留にしていた告白の返事を結愛が急に返してきたせいで、いきなり二股クズ野郎の称号を押しつけられることに。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"二股しちゃったものはしょうがないと開き直るが、今後のビジョンはまったく持ち合わせていない。"}],"source":"bangumi","sourceCharacterId":"103005"}],"profileFacts":[],"metadataCandidateConflicts":{},"image":{"url":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/02/02ca4a5fa30d756c90516ac4711b29fd7daf789a67c331652bb31338df3330c8.webp","fallbackUrl":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/7e/7e6abf924c2cc533c5a602cc28509cf8f9d649f94e95aa3c5694e67e62281019.webp","width":256,"height":256,"source":"static-detail"},"actors":[]},{"characterId":"char_c102482","characterName":"茨 精華","sourceIds":{"bangumi":[{"characterId":"104391","match":"exact-normalized-name-in-linked-work","subjectId":"356907"}],"egsCharacterIds":["23899"],"vndbCharacterId":"c102482"},"originalCharacterName":"茨 精華","characterNameSource":null,"role":"side","status":"source-only-candidate","identityStatus":"confirmed-redirect","metadata":{"sex":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"f"}},"descriptions":[{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"結愛の親友で、学内では彼女と一二を争う人気女子。まさしく太陽と月。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"常に落ち着いていて、その一挙手一投足すべてが静謐さに包まれている。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"なにを考えているんだかよく分からないところもあるが、それなりに常識人。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"気軽に触れられないようなオーラを纏っているので、結果よく一緒にいる結愛にも男が寄って行きにくくなっている。"}],"source":"egs","sourceCharacterId":"23899","sourceWorkId":"31900","spoiler":false},{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"結愛の親友で、学内では彼女と一二を争う人気女子。まさしく太陽と月。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"常に落ち着いていて、その一挙手一投足すべてが静謐さに包まれている。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"なにを考えているんだかよく分からないところもあるが、それなりに常識人。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"気軽に触れられないようなオーラを纏っているので、結果よく一緒にいる結愛にも男が寄って行きにくくなっている。"}],"source":"bangumi","sourceCharacterId":"104391"}],"profileFacts":[],"metadataCandidateConflicts":{},"image":{"url":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/86/8613e4612b664d6c304ea4cd06ce8045fcdd581a704274d238e067be91e9fa23.webp","fallbackUrl":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/16/1645d17175f56cca2621b164d99c9595135ea8e99a6e7f45932d03dc012ebb83.webp","width":137,"height":256,"source":"static-detail"},"actors":[{"creditedName":"七種結花","creatorId":"vndb:s22881","sourcePersonId":"vndb:s22881","canonicalEntityId":"vndb:s22881","name":"佐藤 詩乃","roleCode":"voice-actor","roleLabel":"声优","identityStatus":"auto-confirmed","relationId":"bangumi:character-voice:356907:104391:56606:1","source":"bangumi"}]},{"characterId":"char_c102484","characterName":"エロウサギ","sourceIds":{"bangumi":[{"characterId":"104392","match":"exact-normalized-name-in-linked-work","subjectId":"356907"}],"egsCharacterIds":["23900"],"vndbCharacterId":"c102484"},"originalCharacterName":"エロウサギ","characterNameSource":null,"role":"side","status":"source-only-candidate","identityStatus":"confirmed-redirect","metadata":{"sex":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"f"}},"descriptions":[{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"Meet Layla, Kirame's trusty sidekick for their Japanese study abroad adventure. This girl's so free-spirited you'll get whiplash trying to keep up with her antics."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"Talk about a ray of sunshine! Layla's the poster child for \"ignorance is bliss,\" bouncing through life with a big smile and not a care in the world. Negative vibes? She wouldn't know them even if they slapped her in the face."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"Hanging out with Layla is like basking in sunshine – you can't help but catch her infectious good vibes. Fair warning, though; her friendliness might have you barking up the wrong tree more often than not. \"Is she into me?\" Spoiler alert: probably not."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"If anything could ever dampen her spirits, it would be seeing Kirame sad."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"As for her Japanese skills, she's picking up the lingo from Kirame, but let's just say her real sensei is anime and manga. At this point, she's basically a walking, talking otaku-lite dictionary."}],"source":"vndb","sourceCharacterId":"c102484"},{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"一緒に日本へと留学しに来た煌の親友。いろいろ開放的で目のやりどころに困る。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"常にポジティブ、他人の悪意など一切考えず、まっすぐ明るく元気に振る舞う、天真爛漫の申し子。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"一緒にいるだけで明るく笑顔になれる。もしかしてこの子俺のこと好きなんじゃないか？と勘違いさせちゃうことも多々ある。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"もし彼女が曇ることがあるとしたら、自分ではなく煌が悲しんだときだろう。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"日本語は煌に教えてもらいながら、アニメや漫画で覚えたライトオタク。"}],"source":"egs","sourceCharacterId":"23900","sourceWorkId":"31900","spoiler":false},{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"一緒に日本へと留学しに来た煌の親友。いろいろ開放的で目のやりどころに困る。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"常にポジティブ、他人の悪意など一切考えず、まっすぐ明るく元気に振る舞う、天真爛漫の申し子。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"一緒にいるだけで明るく笑顔になれる。もしかしてこの子俺のこと好きなんじゃないか？と勘違いさせちゃうことも多々ある。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"もし彼女が曇ることがあるとしたら、自分ではなく煌が悲しんだときだろう。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"日本語は煌に教えてもらいながら、アニメや漫画で覚えたライトオタク。"}],"source":"bangumi","sourceCharacterId":"104392"}],"profileFacts":[],"metadataCandidateConflicts":{},"image":{"url":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/85/85435c5f19910a9c26bc70619f4046f1e429eaeb0ac788679dd0b36e116d2064.webp","fallbackUrl":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/c5/c5a0183b2dd56f6256b61c30572c96d3040004844da7d2f56a3c0405ef7f705f.webp","width":97,"height":256,"source":"static-detail"},"actors":[{"creditedName":"平野有紗","creatorId":"vndb:s4474","sourcePersonId":"vndb:s4474","canonicalEntityId":"vndb:s4474","name":"平野 有紗","roleCode":"voice-actor","roleLabel":"声优","identityStatus":"auto-confirmed","relationId":"bangumi:character-voice:356907:104392:30292:1","source":"bangumi"}]},{"characterId":"char_c102485","characterName":"なごみん","sourceIds":{"bangumi":[{"characterId":"104393","match":"exact-normalized-name-in-linked-work","subjectId":"356907"}],"egsCharacterIds":["23901"],"vndbCharacterId":"c102485"},"originalCharacterName":"なごみん","characterNameSource":null,"role":"side","status":"source-only-candidate","identityStatus":"confirmed-redirect","metadata":{"sex":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"f"}},"descriptions":[{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"主人公と宮子の暮らす寮の寮長。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"ほんわか穏やかな性格で、精神が荒ぶったときは、なごみんと一緒にいるとリラックス効果を得られるのでオススメ。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"ただし依存性があるため、乱用には注意が必要。よくママと呼ばれがち。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"燿は幼馴染みで弟のような存在。いつも外をほっつき歩いている彼が心配でしょうがない。"}],"source":"egs","sourceCharacterId":"23901","sourceWorkId":"31900","spoiler":false},{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"主人公と宮子の暮らす寮の寮長。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"ほんわか穏やかな性格で、精神が荒ぶったときは、なごみんと一緒にいるとリラックス効果を得られるのでオススメ。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"ただし依存性があるため、乱用には注意が必要。よくママと呼ばれがち。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"燿は幼馴染みで弟のような存在。いつも外をほっつき歩いている彼が心配でしょうがない。"}],"source":"bangumi","sourceCharacterId":"104393"}],"profileFacts":[],"metadataCandidateConflicts":{},"image":{"url":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/c2/c29c53234146dd6a904cd4eb88dc993bce142036c3b07b6259d96a4d74f6e337.webp","fallbackUrl":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/a8/a81d75581b39d51327c1ebc2f133f81f2c1215ffd2d8e212c54aa48110b725df.webp","width":60,"height":256,"source":"static-detail"},"actors":[{"creditedName":"小山さほみ","creatorId":"vndb:s278","sourcePersonId":"vndb:s278","canonicalEntityId":"vndb:s278","name":"小山 さほみ","roleCode":"voice-actor","roleLabel":"声优","identityStatus":"auto-confirmed","relationId":"bangumi:character-voice:356907:104393:6359:1","source":"bangumi"}]},{"characterId":"char_c102486","characterName":"信田 真愛","sourceIds":{"bangumi":[{"characterId":"104394","match":"exact-normalized-name-in-linked-work","subjectId":"356907"}],"egsCharacterIds":["23902"],"vndbCharacterId":"c102486"},"originalCharacterName":"信田 真愛","characterNameSource":null,"role":"side","status":"source-only-candidate","identityStatus":"confirmed-redirect","metadata":{"sex":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"f"}},"descriptions":[{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"Shia is the living, breathing embodiment of pure love. One look at her and you can tell she's been raised in a cocoon of affection – she practically radiates love from every pore."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"As Yua's half-sister (different dads), Shia is dying to bond with her big sis. The only snag? Yua's not exactly rolling out the welcome mat, leaving our little love bug feeling a bit stuck."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"Ironically, Shia's thick as thieves with Rui, and gets along swimmingly with Runa too, despite the sisters being as different as night and day."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"Apart from her love being so intense it could knock you over with a feather, Shia's your typical pure-hearted kid for her age. Talk about wearing your heart on your sleeve!"}],"source":"vndb","sourceCharacterId":"c102486"},{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"純粋な愛の象徴。めちゃくちゃ愛されて育ったのがすぐ分かるぐらい愛に満ちている。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"結愛の父親違いの義妹で、姉と仲良くしたいと思っているが、結愛があまり心を開いてくれないので困っている。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"姉よりも瑠衣と仲良しで、妹同士タイプの違う瑠那とも仲がいい。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"愛があまりにもまっすぐ過ぎて重いこと以外は歳相応に純粋。"}],"source":"egs","sourceCharacterId":"23902","sourceWorkId":"31900","spoiler":false},{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"純粋な愛の象徴。めちゃくちゃ愛されて育ったのがすぐ分かるぐらい愛に満ちている。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"結愛の父親違いの義妹で、姉と仲良くしたいと思っているが、結愛があまり心を開いてくれないので困っている。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"姉よりも瑠衣と仲良しで、妹同士タイプの違う瑠那とも仲がいい。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"愛があまりにもまっすぐ過ぎて重いこと以外は歳相応に純粋。"}],"source":"bangumi","sourceCharacterId":"104394"}],"profileFacts":[],"metadataCandidateConflicts":{},"image":{"url":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/58/588bbced435f2397409a217e50c142e97f1e63586c427b2e274bf79c6b3ca685.webp","fallbackUrl":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/71/7165cb248e870301d64472f95617aff7855b86c3ba479fde42aa630d85699805.webp","width":72,"height":256,"source":"static-detail"},"actors":[{"creditedName":"長みこと","creatorId":"vndb:s18525","sourcePersonId":"vndb:s18525","canonicalEntityId":"vndb:s18525","name":"鳴瀬なごみ","roleCode":"voice-actor","roleLabel":"声优","identityStatus":"auto-confirmed","relationId":"bangumi:character-voice:356907:104394:34378:1","source":"bangumi"}]},{"characterId":"char_c102487","characterName":"御子柴 瑠那","sourceIds":{"bangumi":[